msgctxt "64"
msgid "He's a fuckin' monster!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "This ain't good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Shit! Run for it, boys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Oh my god! Can you believe those idiots!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "And can you believe... I ended up like this...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "You must have been scared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "I guess all this kind of got away from me, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "You have to be a little more careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "I never thought it would get this bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I... I only started this job because I wanted some excitement. I "
"was killing time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"It didn't really mean anything to me. I was just bored with my life, and "
"trying to change that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"But... then I met you, Kiryu-san, and... you cared about me more than I "
"thought anyone ever could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"I know I'm... not the easiest girl to talk to. But then you came along, and "
"everything changed, and now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "...Guess that means this is my fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Like, one hundred percent your fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Hey, it's not funny!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"You think this is easy for me? Here I am, trying to live my life, and I "
"can't get you off my mind, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "So... since it's your fault, you gotta fix it, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, Kiryu-san. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> You won't "
"have to figure it all out yourself. I'll tell you exactly what to do... "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255"
">⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

